║                  START HERE - Credit Risk System                         ║
╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝

🚀 TO START THE ENTIRE SYSTEM (Infrastructure + Services):

    $ ./start-all-services.sh

That's it! This command will:
  • Start Docker containers (PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ, Redis, Keycloak)
  • Wait for infrastructure to be ready
  • Start all 7 .NET services
  • Show you logs and next steps

⚡ QUICK REFERENCE:

  ./start-all-services.sh          # Start everything (default)
  ./start-all-services.sh help     # Show all options
  ./start-all-services.sh infra-only  # Only Docker
  ./start-all-services.sh services-only # Only .NET services
  ./start-all-services.sh tmux     # Use tmux (interactive)
  ./start-all-services.sh background # Use background (logs to /tmp)

📖 DOCUMENTATION:

  STARTUP.md              ← Complete startup guide
  START_SERVICES.md       ← Service details
  GETTING_STARTED.md      ← Quick reference
  docs/API_REFERENCE.md   ← API endpoints
  docs/ARCHITECTURE.md    ← System design

🔍 TESTING:

  After services start (wait ~60 seconds):
  
    curl http://localhost:5001/health
    curl http://localhost:5002/health
    curl http://localhost:5003/health
    curl http://localhost:8081/health

📊 WHAT GETS STARTED:

  Infrastructure (Docker):
    ✓ PostgreSQL (5432)
    ✓ RabbitMQ (5672)
    ✓ Redis (6379)
    ✓ Keycloak (8080)

  Application Services:
    ✓ Bureau Mock Service (8081)
    ✓ IAM API (5000)
    ✓ Credit Analysis API (5001)
    ✓ Compliance API (5002)
    ✓ Operations Server (5003)
    ✓ 2 Background Workers

⚙️ SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS:

  • Docker & Docker Compose
  • .NET 8.0+
  • 4GB RAM minimum
  • Port 5000-5003, 8080-8081 available

❓ NEED HELP?

  ./start-all-services.sh help     # Detailed options
  tail -f /tmp/credit.log          # View service logs
  docker-compose ps                # Check containers
  docker-compose logs -f           # Docker logs

🎯 READY?

  Run this now:
    $ ./start-all-services.sh

